<h3><u>Alwida alwida ae behen alwida</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>alwida alwida ae behen alwida<br />
shahe tashna dahan, bewatan bekafan<br />
waqt e rukhsat ye kehte the meri behen</p>

<p>alwida alwida ae behen alwida..(3)</p>

<p>1. Hum to ran ko chale, alwida alwida<br />
khoo me rote hue, alwida alwida<br />
kya kare jeeke ab, alwida alwida<br />
lut chuka hai chaman, alwida alwida</p>

<p>alwida alwida ae behen alwida..(3)</p>

<p>2. Bhai maara gaya, alwida alwida<br />
har sahara gaya, alwida alwida<br />
tukde tukde hua, alwida alwida<br />
haaye ibn e hasan, alwida alwida</p>

<p>alwida alwida ae behen alwida..(3)</p>

<p>3. Haaye akbar jawaa, alwida alwida<br />
rahate qalb o jaan, alwida alwida<br />
kha chuka hai sina, alwida alwida<br />
khu me tarr hai badan, alwida alwida</p>

<p>alwida alwida ae behen alwida..(3)</p>

<p>4. Jhoola veeran hai, alwida alwida<br />
lab pe ab jaan hai, alwida alwida<br />
laashe asghar hai aur, alwida alwida<br />
jal raha hai ye ban, alwida alwida</p>

<p>alwida alwida ae behen alwida..(3)</p>

<p>5. Ab sakina meri, alwida alwida<br />
kis tarah soegi, alwida alwida<br />
khaegi ghudkiya, alwida alwida<br />
aur bandhegi rasan, alwida alwida</p>

<p>alwida alwida ae behen alwida..(3)</p>

<p>6. Jab chinegi rida, alwida alwida<br />
zainab e ghum zada, alwida alwida<br />
sabr karna bohot, alwida alwida<br />
sehna ranj o mahan, alwida alwida</p>

<p>alwida alwida ae behen alwida..(3)</p>

<p>7. Ghash me hai laadla, alwida alwida<br />
yani zainul eba, alwida alwida<br />
ab hawale tere, alwida alwida<br />
hai mera gul badan, alwida alwida</p>

<p>alwida alwida ae behen alwida..(3)</p>

<p>8. Shaam jana hai ab, alwida alwida<br />
hai bada ye ghazab, alwida alwida<br />
berida hogi tu, alwida alwida<br />
roenge panjetan, alwida alwida</p>

<p>alwida alwida ae behen alwida..(3)</p>

<p>9. Jake bazaar me, alwida alwida<br />
aur darbaar me, alwida alwida<br />
mere paigham ko, alwida alwida<br />
bhoona na behen, alwida alwida</p>

<p>alwida alwida ae behen alwida..(3)</p>

<p>10. Meesam e ghum zada, alwida alwida<br />
nauha rehan ka, alwida alwida<br />
maine padh to diya, alwida alwida<br />
gunja sheh ka sukhan, alwida alwida</p>

<p>alwida alwida ae behen alwida..(3)</p>
</p>